# The Dockerfile's `COPY . .` takes this whole directory as the build context.
# gateway/compat/ is the compatibility matrix (RFC-1 §11, item 11 slice S12):
# a separate, test-only Go module with its own SDK dependencies and, on a
# developer machine, a uv virtualenv under compat/python/.venv. None of it is
# part of the gateway binary or its image, and the virtualenv alone can be
# hundreds of megabytes of context to upload for nothing.
compat/
